      "writtenOn": "2023-12-13T09:13:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you. I updated the comment. Could you take another look?\n\n\u003e must have the RKP VM flag in it...\n\nThe RKP VM flag is only relevant for RKP server. For pvmfw, a VM is considered as RKP VM only when it has the RKP VM flag, so it\u0027s unnecessary to check that RKP VM has the RKP VM flag.",
      "parentUuid": "fa428f46_9743ae6e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 159,
